#: scenario:scenario_2AFF8341_4A3E_430F_A1D6_31F2D481EF83
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 89962273eb883dd76f5b9e2f8374cad499048b635a9cf31a7629765957174bb1
#. default-sha256: f77582ffcd5d32b2c3f8ee3e4afa41f972f3c3b24a3707fb1b433f25fb232a62
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2AFF8341_4A3E_430F_A1D6_31F2D481EF83"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The crestfallen young man faded into the distance, and the decrepit double doors "
"clacked shut."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Il giovane avvilito si disperse in lontananza, e la doppia porta decrepita si richiuse."

#: scenario:scenario_43A49B46_7AAD_44A2_B999_45334FEA1E47
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d7e7954ffe9cbca012acea9941a5c3c1eda5213428fdc380069b51fe6e1edfc8
#. default-sha256: 97c5a81b92de24f2b5181f263f16d6c19518108f09ba5e0fee4facaf44b243e5
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_43A49B46_7AAD_44A2_B999_45334FEA1E47"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Through the shattered glass, ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫the Departed⟪k:3⟫ could see only the ruins of a "
"garden, not a single rose growing within. ⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫You⟪k:6⟫He⟪k:7⟫ had evidently returned from "
"the past."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Attraverso il vetro in frantumi, ⟪k:1⟫riuscivi⟪k:2⟫il Defunto riusciva⟪k:3⟫ a vedere "
"solamente⟪k:4⟫ ⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫i resti di un giardino, dove non cresceva più neanche una rosa.⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Sembravi⟪k:11⟫Sembrava⟪k:12⟫ essere tornato dal passato."

#: scenario:scenario_0FB3F01D_B617_4D13_8095_F4F8541039DF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d8c657a2a8ce375fdc9c56f008fd5c35708bf2be5b01452d110164e95f98511f
#. default-sha256: 96688311172ca37d0d6f32fe53be33305b8e7bd3978a7bea4e3f74c2ef9d2a27
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0FB3F01D_B617_4D13_8095_F4F8541039DF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In the garden, weeds grew taller than people. ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫He⟪k:3⟫ found it difficult to "
"look at. ⟪k:4⟫A wolf howled in the distance."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nel giardino, le erbacce crescevano più alte delle persone; ⟪k:1⟫era una vista difficile da "
"sostenere."

#: scenario:scenario_93B40010_CB1F_4857_8A6C_0EE53963A89B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 042f0d8d36b1d11de1deb36d24b463666be56cf1224409bcd4214ca4f4ba13cc
#. default-sha256: 640f221d6b053656dcd9348eb5e2cb5ef4ea43064cdc815a538b3483bc94b28a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_93B40010_CB1F_4857_8A6C_0EE53963A89B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The children, the sea of roses, and the White-Haired Girl were nowhere to be found."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫In lontananza, si sentì un lupo ululare, ma oltre a quello non vi era alcun suono.⟪k:1⟫ I "
"bambini, il mare di rose e la Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi non si trovavano da nessuna parte."

