"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Tu⟪k:2⟫Il Defunto⟪k:3⟫ e la Domestica che ⟪k:4⟫Ti⟪k:5⟫lo⟪k:6⟫ chiamava “Padrone” ⟪k:7⟫"
