msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Your⟪k:13⟫The "
"Departed’s⟪k:14⟫ hand in hers, the Maid guided ⟪k:15⟫You⟪k:16⟫him⟪k:17⟫ back through the kitchen "
"and into the tea room. ⟪k:18⟫Her palms were still cold; ⟪k:19⟫You⟪k:20⟫the Departed⟪k:21⟫ felt as "
"though ⟪k:22⟫You⟪k:23⟫he⟪k:24⟫ were clenching ice."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Tenendoti⟪k:13⟫"
"Tenendolo⟪k:14⟫ per mano, la Domestica ⟪k:15⟫Ti guidò⟪k:16⟫lo guidò⟪k:17⟫ attraverso la cucina e "
"la sala da tè. ⟪k:18⟫La sua mano era ancora gelida; ⟪k:19⟫Ti⟪k:20⟫al Defunto⟪k:21⟫ sembrava come "
"se ⟪k:22⟫stessi⟪k:23⟫stesse⟪k:24⟫ stringendo del ghiaccio."

